GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "A4EFFFB78317417B"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{79046DC648151760}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Summary"
     m_sContent "British light infantry move to assault a separatist-held hamlet in the Ruha region, where entrenched fighters have fortified a checkpoint along a key Alternative Supply Route. The outcome of the engagement will determine whether the route is reopened to government forces or remains under separatist control."\
     ""\
     ""\
     "<h2>Summary notes</h2>"\
     ""
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{48771CB7539C729E}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
     "DTL: 23/07/2021, 0800hr, Ruha."\
     "Weather: Heavy overcast with moderate rain."\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
     "Over the past few days, experienced separatist fighters have taken control of a small hamlet along a key Alternative Supply Route (ASR) in the Ruha region. They have since fortified the area, establishing defensive positions and a checkpoint to dominate the road."\
     ""\
     "From this position, the separatists have been stopping and extorting civilian traffic while preventing Ruha Security Forces from moving reinforcements and supplies through the area. Their continued presence is disrupting movement across the region and strengthening their hold on the surrounding territory."\
     ""\
     "In response, a platoon from the Princess of Wales’s Royal Regiment, has been tasked with clearing the hamlet, restoring freedom of movement along the MSR, and removing the separatist threat from the area."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{D01CDEA447B7407C}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
     "DTL: 23/07/2021, 0800hr, Ruha."\
     "Weather: Heavy overcast with moderate rain."\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
     "Over the past few days, our fighters have successfully seized control of a small hamlet along a key Alternative Supply Route (ASR) in the Ruha region. We have since fortified the area, establishing defensive positions and a checkpoint to dominate the road and control all movement through it."\
     ""\
     "From this position, we have been able to halt and search civilian traffic while preventing Ruha Security Forces from moving reinforcements and supplies through the area. Our control of this route has begun to disrupt enemy movement across the region and strengthen our presence in the surrounding territory."\
     ""\
     "In response, a platoon from the Princess of Wales’s Royal Regiment has been tasked with retaking the hamlet, restoring their freedom of movement along the route, and removing us from the area by force."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{D1653BA6CC7A508C}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "Enemy forces consist of an experienced, motorised separatist cell estimated at approximately 25 personnel in strength.  "\
     "They are currently dug in within a small hamlet located west of our position at GRID: 061081"\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• Partisan reports indicate the cell operates with 1× BRDM, attack drone capability, and several unarmed vehicles used for transport.  "\
     "• The enemy has had several days to prepare the area, establishing infantry fighting positions and vehicle cover in and around the hamlet.  "\
     "A fortified checkpoint has been constructed along the ASR, featuring a bunker and a static PKM oriented south down the road.  "\
     "All known enemy positions have been marked on the map."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{2806B672EF838DC6}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "We are light infantry from 3rd Platoon, B Company, 2nd Battalion, Princess of Wales’s Royal Regiment.  "\
     "The platoon consists of 32 personnel and is currently staged at the harbour area due east at GRID: 070077, ready to step off immediately."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• Anti-tank team attached to us in HQ. "\
     "• Organic drone reconnaissance available at HQ level.  "\
     "• A counter-drone specialist equipped with a jammer effective up to 300 metres is attached to HQ."\
     "• Each section is equipped with 1× LAW66 L1A1 anti-tank launcher.  "\
     "• Everyone has optics."\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "A supply crate is available at the staging location containing:  "\
     "• 1× MAVIC reconnaissance drone  "\
     "• 4× MAVIC batteries  "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{D213A3FC739B2F89}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "Enemy forces consist of light infantry from the Princess of Wales’s Royal Regiment.  "\
     "The platoon is estimated at approximately 30 personnel and is currently on the move towards us from the east having just left their harbour area."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• The enemy has access to organic drone reconnaissance at HQ level, allowing them to observe our positions before committing to an assault.  "\
     "• A counter-drone specialist equipped with a jammer effective up to 300 metres is believed to be attached to their headquarters element.  "\
     "• Each enemy section is equipped with 1× LAW66 L1A1 anti-tank launcher, posing a direct threat to our vehicles and fortified positions.  "\
     "• All enemy personnel are issued optical sights."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{DBBA5A3DC564A866}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "We are an experienced, motorised separatist cell consisting of approximately 26 fighters in total.  "\
     "Our forces are currently dug in within a small hamlet located at GRID: 061081, where we have established control over the surrounding area and the nearby ASR."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• We operate with 1× BRDM, limited attack drone capability, and several unarmed vehicles for transport and rapid movement.  "\
     "• Over the past few days, we have prepared the hamlet for defence, constructing infantry fighting positions and establishing vehicle cover throughout the area.  "\
     "• A fortified checkpoint has been established along the ASR, featuring a bunker and a static PKM oriented south down the road to control approaching traffic.  "\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "A supply crate is available at the staging location containing:  "\
     "• 2× MAVIC grenade dropper drones"\
     "• 2x spare batteries"\
     "• 6x spare RGD grenades we can use to rearm the drone."\
     "- In theory, you can give up your personal RGD grenades to the drone operator and increase his ammo by alot, or you can take the RGD grenades for the infantry, either/or."\
     "• 4x strands of 2.5m placeable barbwire."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{F1EA3601163DF1BD}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
     "Our missision is to conduct a DELIBERATE ASSAULT to SECURE the hamlet in order to DISRUPT separatist operations along the ASR and restore freedom of movement through the area."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
     "Separatist forces have occupied and fortified a hamlet along an ASR. Using it as a checkpoint to control civilian traffic, extort locals, and block Ruha Security Forces from reinforcing further south."\
     ""\
     "3rd Platoon has been tasked with conducting a deliberate clearance of the hamlet. We are to advance from the east, neutralize all hostile forces, and secure the settlement to allow normal traffic and security movement to resume along the ASR."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{8CDB1CF3CCB33AFF}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
     "Our mission is to conduct a DELIBERATE DEFENCE of the hamlet against an impending British assault."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
     "British forces have been sighted to the east of our position. Scouts indicates they are staging at a harbour area and preparing to strike."\
     "Their objective will be to dislodge our forces from the hamlet, dismantle our checkpoint, and reopen the ASR to allow Ruha Security Forces to move reinforcements and supplies through the region once more."\
     ""\
     "Holding this hamlet and maintaining control of the checkpoint is vital to preventing enemy forces from regaining freedom of movement and re-establishing their presence in the area."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
